They all use MediaPipe hand tracking; just allow camera access.', array['oyun', 'oyunlar', 'oyna', 'oynanabilir', 'eglence', 'game', 'games', 'play', 'playable', 'fun']::text[], '[{"label":{"tr":"Neon Pong''u oyna","en":"Play Neon Pong"},"href":"/projects/pong-with-mediapipe/play"},{"label":{"tr":"Flying Birds''ü oyna","en":"Play Flying Birds"},"href":"/projects/flying-birds-with-mediapipe/play"},{"label":{"tr":"Sihirli Sapan''ı oyna","en":"Play Sihirli Sapan"},"href":"/projects/sihirli-sapan/play"}]'::jsonb, array['project-neon-pong', 'project-sihirli-sapan', 'project-kozmik-toz']::text[])
