• Web Audio API ile retro sesler

Teknolojiler: Vanilla JS, HTML5 Canvas, Web Audio API, MediaPipe', 'Neon Pong AI: a futuristic neon Pong game you play with hand gestures via webcam and MediaPipe hand tracking.
• AI opponent with a human-like error margin; the ball speeds up as rallies get longer
• Team choice (left/right, mirror-aware), adjustable starting speed
• Retro sounds via the Web Audio API

Tech: Vanilla JS, HTML5 Canvas, Web Audio API, MediaPipe', array['pong', 'neon']::text[], '[{"label":{"tr":"README","en":"README"},"href":"/projects/pong-with-mediapipe"},{"label":{"tr":"Oyna","en":"Play"},"href":"/projects/pong-with-mediapipe/play"}]'::jsonb, array['project-flying-birds', 'playable-games']::text[])
