• HSD color palette and custom SVG art

Shared as open source.', array['edition', 'maskot', 'mascot', 'leaderboard']::text[], '[{"label":{"tr":"README","en":"README"},"href":"/projects/sihirli-sapan-hsd-edition"},{"label":{"tr":"Oyna","en":"Play"},"href":"/projects/sihirli-sapan-hsd-edition/play"}]'::jsonb, array['hsd', 'project-sihirli-sapan']::text[])
